</div>
<div class="reveal">
<Banking client:load/>
</div>
<div class="feature-row">
<div>
<span>↗</span>
<b>The whole picture</b>
<p>All your demo balances, together.</p>
</div>
<div>
<span>◎</span>
<b>Space for your goals</b>
<p>Make room for what comes next.</p>
</div>
<div>
<span>⌘</span>
<b>Insights that make sense</b>
<p>Understand the way you spend.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="payments" class="section payments">
<div class="split">
<div class="section-copy reveal">
<span class="eyebrow">02 — GO A LITTLE FURTHER</span>
